{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i>Dr. Crimson suggests a different approach. He believes the key lies in prolonging the induced state, pushing the subject deeper into the convergence points. \u201cLet them linger,\u201d he wrote in his latest notes. \u201cLet them witness.\u201d</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You wake up in a house that seems abandoned. How did you get here? More importantly, how will you escape?\u00a0 You come across notes\u2014written in your own handwriting, yet you have no memory of writing them. Someone\u2014or something\u2014might be watching you. But the most unsettling part is trying to decipher the meaning behind your own words...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And then you see them. T<strong>wisted shapes, born from something you\u2019ve tried to forget.</strong>\u00a0They are echoes of your past, memories turned against you<strong>, r</strong>eshaped into something ... monstrous. And you feel like<strong> each step pulls you back\u2014to the places you swore you\u2019d never return.</strong> The museum. The hospital room. That night ...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Crimson Theory reminds you that fear isn\u2019t just something lurking in the shadows\u2014it\u2019s the uncertainty that takes root in the mind. The line between dreams and reality is gone. Your mind is on the battlefield, and something is trying to break in. This isn\u2019t just survival. <strong>It\u2019s a reckoning.</strong> When the final door opens, you won\u2019t escape. <strong>You\u2019ll remember.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Atmospheric psychological horror</strong> with a creeping sense of dread.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 <strong>A story-driven experience</strong> where reality twists and distorts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Unravel cryptic messages</strong> and uncover the truth behind the hospital.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 <strong>No cheap jumpscares\u2014</strong>only pure, lingering dread.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3572820?t=1742617233","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3572820?t=1742617233","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572820/e06abc6d9b52e21564a4d24923ef12bb740bc621/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742617233","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572820/e06abc6d9b52e21564a4d24923ef12bb740bc621/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742617233","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i>Dr. Crimson suggests a different approach. He believes the key lies in prolonging the induced state, pushing the subject deeper into the convergence points. \u201cLet them linger,\u201d he wrote in his latest notes. \u201cLet them witness.\u201d</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You wake up in a house that seems abandoned. How did you get here? More importantly, how will you escape?\u00a0 You come across notes\u2014written in your own handwriting, yet you have no memory of writing them. Someone\u2014or something\u2014might be watching you. But the most unsettling part is trying to decipher the meaning behind your own words...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And then you see them. T<strong>wisted shapes, born from something you\u2019ve tried to forget.</strong>\u00a0They are echoes of your past, memories turned against you<strong>, r</strong>eshaped into something ... monstrous. And you feel like<strong> each step pulls you back\u2014to the places you swore you\u2019d never return.</strong> The museum. The hospital room. That night ...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Crimson Theory reminds you that fear isn\u2019t just something lurking in the shadows\u2014it\u2019s the uncertainty that takes root in the mind. The line between dreams and reality is gone. Your mind is on the battlefield, and something is trying to break in. This isn\u2019t just survival. <strong>It\u2019s a reckoning.</strong> When the final door opens, you won\u2019t escape. <strong>You\u2019ll remember.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Atmospheric psychological horror</strong> with a creeping sense of dread.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 <strong>A story-driven experience</strong> where reality twists and distorts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Unravel cryptic messages</strong> and uncover the truth behind the hospital.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 <strong>No cheap jumpscares\u2014</strong>only pure, lingering dread.</p>","developers":["Kutkut"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572820/21b5a62b298f5842853fa76cc4676624b3c0e18b/header.jpg?t=1742617233","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257114063,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257114063/movie480.mp4?t=1742611260","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/25711